+# lance-pipnn
+
+Optional native PiPNN graph builder for Lance (feature `pipnn` of `lance-index`).
+It backs the PiPNN centroid assigner and the `IVF_PIPNN_FLAT` partition sub-index.
+
+The C++ builder (`cpp/fastpipnn.hpp`) is compiled with portable flags and needs Eigen
+headers (`EIGEN_INCLUDE_DIR`). Distance kernels are chosen once per process
+(`kernel_name()`): SSE2 on x86_64, NEON on aarch64, and SVE when the compiler
+builds `cpp/kernels_sve.c` and Linux reports SVE. `LANCE_PIPNN_SCALAR=1` forces
+the scalar kernels; `LANCE_PIPNN_NATIVE=1` builds with `-march=native`.
